          "type": "text",
          "text": "Site coordinators noted limited access during heavy rain while preparing a replacement frame. An observer stands 23 m from a vertical tower at the bicycle parking shelter. The angle of elevation from eye level to the top is 50°, and the observer’s eye is 1.6 m above the ground. Find the tower height correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
      ],
